#   math_ml_mi_element - MathML::MathMLMiElement: <mi> and its mathvariant presentational hint
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/MathML/MathMLMiElement.cpp (lines 1-42): construction (which
#       moves the mixin tables to MathMLMiElement's, as C++'s vptrs move) and the mathvariant
#       presentational hint.
